{"ts":"2026-07-06T22:02:04.911Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"Observed in audit #15 on pm-rjqr: codex released its claim after PR #466 merged, the item silently stayed in_progress with claimed_by=none, and it surfaced as phantom WIP until a manual audit reset it. pm release only clears the claim; the status transition is a separate manual step that agents forget at end-of-session. Complements pm-w8q4 (after-the-fact detection) by preventing the drift at the moment it happens. pause-task already bundles release+open, but per ADR pm-pbyu it is sugar slated to fold into claim/release flags (pm-eq4x) — this issue is the release-side flag/hint itself."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-ugld"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"pm release leaves the item in_progress with no owner: offer --status open (or hint) so released work does not linger as phantom WIP"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":""},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":3},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-ux","area:concurrency","dogfood"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-06T22:02:04.911Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-06T22:02:04.911Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"maintainer-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":120},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"pm release gains an ergonomic path to also reset status (flag such as --reopen/--status open, or at minimum a one-line hint that the item remains in_progress and unclaimed); pause-task alias behavior is referenced as the existing combined spelling; MCP pm_release mirrors the option; docs + linked tests; default behavior unchanged"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-dj98"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"low"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"85b9a3917413d6d69a1b56ced52e54d994f728edc714b1d68adaa1aa79de562d","message":""}
